# Q1: Which equities trade on NASDAQ?

PREFIX : <https://froilan-sia.github.io/finance-ontology-rag/ontology#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?equity ?name ?issuer
WHERE {
    ?equity a :Equity ;
            :tradedOn :NASDAQ ;
            :issuedBy ?issuer ;
            rdfs:label ?name .
}
